{"id":"n26891-1-18","stage":1,"title":"운동장 · 运动场","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26891-1-18-1","ko":"오늘 수업 끝나고 학교 운동장에서 옆 반 애들이랑 축구 시합 하자.","zh":"今天下课之后，我们在学校操场上和隔壁班的同学踢足球吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"수업","meaning":"授课，讲课","explanation":"수업：授课，讲课","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나고","meaning":"下课，下班","explanation":"끝나다：下课，下班；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나고","audio":"/audio/02bfa899d696ea03947a.mp3"}},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}},{"text":"운동장에서","meaning":"运动场，体育场","explanation":"운동장：运动场，体育场；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"운동장","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26891","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동장에서","audio":"/audio/64c1c5085fe644a25d12.mp3"}},{"text":"옆","meaning":"旁，旁边","explanation":"옆：旁，旁边","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}},{"text":"반","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}},{"text":"애들이랑","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애들이랑","audio":"/audio/e539716eb7ac1eeb98d0.mp3"}},{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}},{"text":"시합","meaning":"比赛","explanation":"시합：比赛","readings":[{"term":"시합","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13985","senseId":"1","lemma":"시합","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시합","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3"}},{"text":"하자.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하자","audio":"/audio/04b9b32cf095cdd41c5b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"01c1761e85dc638b","term":"수업","zh":"授课，讲课","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3","entryId":"64597","definition":"教师教学生知识或技术。","pronunciation":["수업"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"下课，下班","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"在学校或公司等地方做完当天的功课或业务。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"899e5787d5587fd1","term":"운동장","zh":"运动场，体育场","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3","entryId":"26891","definition":"为能够进行体育比赛、游玩等而设有多种器具或设施的宽阔场所。","pronunciation":["운ː동장"]},{"id":"c140e1936b454b24","term":"옆","zh":"旁，旁边","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3","entryId":"20243","definition":"指左右两侧中的一侧。","pronunciation":["엽"]},{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"班，班级","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57301","definition":"学校里把一个年级以教室为单位划分的团体。","pronunciation":["반"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"944bf12d99b921ad","term":"시합","zh":"比赛","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3","entryId":"13985","definition":"体育比赛等互相发挥实力决胜负。","pronunciation":["시합"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b703e646f29a6fa5fd91.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26891-1-18-2","ko":"좋아. 승규랑 민준이도 같이 하는 거지?","zh":"好啊。承奎和敏俊也会一起参加对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"승규랑","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"승규랑","audio":"/audio/6fee231a092f9f8d9b8c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규랑","audio":"/audio/6fee231a092f9f8d9b8c.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이도","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"민준이도","audio":"/audio/6025ee99267d8c798817.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이도","audio":"/audio/6025ee99267d8c798817.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거지","audio":"/audio/a9e973ff709d931a2b92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/017147de7403b40b186a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.919,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26891","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"sequenceScore":2.3697,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊。承奎和敏俊也会一起参加对吧？","今天下课之后，我们在学校操场上和隔壁班的同学踢足球吧。","这沙发看起来真大。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天下课之后，我们在学校操场上和隔壁班的同学踢足球吧。","这沙发看起来真大。","好啊。承奎和敏俊也会一起参加对吧？"],"answer":2}]}
